# Deny local state and credentials at every depth.
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*credentials*
**/*secrets*
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.local
**/.DS_Store
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.log
**/runs
**/uploads
**/sessions
**/dist
**/.agent-cache
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
